{"v":[{"a":["سَبِّحِ","ٱسۡمَ","رَبِّكَ","ٱلۡأَعۡلَى"],"t":"Praise the Name of your Lord, the Most High","l":"Sabbihi Asma Rabbika Al-'A`la","w":[["sabbiḥi","Glorify"],["is'ma","(the) name"],["rabbika","(of) your Lord"],["l-aʿlā","the Most High"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي","خَلَقَ","فَسَوَّىٰ"],"t":"He who creates and regulates","l":"Al-Ladhi Khalaqa Fasawwa","w":[["alladhī","The One Who"],["khalaqa","created"],["fasawwā","then proportioned"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِي","قَدَّرَ","فَهَدَىٰ"],"t":"He who measures and guides","l":"Wa Al-Ladhi Qaddara Fahada","w":[["wa-alladhī","And the One Who"],["qaddara","measured"],["fahadā","then guided"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّذِيٓ","أَخۡرَجَ","ٱلۡمَرۡعَىٰ"],"t":"He who produces the pasture","l":"Wa Al-Ladhi 'Akhraja Al-Mar`a","w":[["wa-alladhī","And the One Who"],["akhraja","brings forth"],["l-marʿā","the pasture"]]},{"a":["فَجَعَلَهُۥ","غُثَآءً","أَحۡوَىٰ"],"t":"And then turns it into light debris","l":"Faja`alahu Ghutha'an 'Ahwa","w":[["fajaʿalahu","And then makes it"],["ghuthāan","stubble"],["aḥwā","dark"]]},{"a":["سَنُقۡرِئُكَ","فَلَا","تَنسَىٰٓ"],"t":"We will make you read, so do not forget","l":"Sanuqri'uka Fala Tansa","w":[["sanuq'ri-uka","We will make you recite"],["falā","so not"],["tansā","you will forget"]]},{"a":["إِلَّا","مَا","شَآءَ","ٱللَّهُۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","يَعۡلَمُ","ٱلۡجَهۡرَ","وَمَا","يَخۡفَىٰ"],"t":"Except what God wills. He knows what is declared, and what is hidden","l":"Illa Ma Sha'a Allahu 'Innahu Ya`lamu Al-Jahra Wa Ma Yakhfa","w":[["illā","Except"],["mā","what"],["shāa","wills"],["l-lahu","Allah"],["innahu","Indeed, He"],["yaʿlamu","knows"],["l-jahra","the manifest"],["wamā","and what"],["yakhfā","is hidden"]]},{"a":["وَنُيَسِّرُكَ","لِلۡيُسۡرَىٰ"],"t":"We will ease you into the Easy Way","l":"Wa Nuyassiruka Lilyusra","w":[["wanuyassiruka","And We will ease you"],["lil'yus'rā","to the ease"]]},{"a":["فَذَكِّرۡ","إِن","نَّفَعَتِ","ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰ"],"t":"So remind, if reminding helps","l":"Fadhakkir 'In Nafa`ati Adh-Dhikra","w":[["fadhakkir","So remind"],["in","if"],["nafaʿati","benefits"],["l-dhik'rā","the reminder"]]},{"a":["سَيَذَّكَّرُ","مَن","يَخۡشَىٰ"],"t":"The reverent will remember","l":"Sayadhakkaru Man Yakhsha","w":[["sayadhakkaru","He will pay heed "],["man","(one) who"],["yakhshā","fears (Allah)"]]},{"a":["وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا","ٱلۡأَشۡقَى"],"t":"But the wretched will avoid it","l":"Wa Yatajannabuha Al-'Ashqa","w":[["wayatajannabuhā","And will avoid it"],["l-ashqā","the wretched one"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِي","يَصۡلَى","ٱلنَّارَ","ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ"],"t":"He who will enter the Gigantic Fire","l":"Al-Ladhi Yasla An-Nara Al-Kubra","w":[["alladhī","The one who"],["yaṣlā","will burn"],["l-nāra","(in) the Fire"],["l-kub'rā","[the] great"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","لَا","يَمُوتُ","فِيهَا","وَلَا","يَحۡيَىٰ"],"t":"Where he will neither die, nor live","l":"Thumma La Yamutu Fiha Wa La Yahya","w":[["thumma","Then"],["lā","not"],["yamūtu","he will die"],["fīhā","therein"],["walā","and not"],["yaḥyā","will live"]]},{"a":["قَدۡ","أَفۡلَحَ","مَن","تَزَكَّىٰ"],"t":"Successful is he who purifies himself","l":"Qad 'Aflaha Man Tazakka","w":[["qad","Certainly"],["aflaḥa","has succeeded"],["man","(one) who"],["tazakkā","purifies (himself)"]]},{"a":["وَذَكَرَ","ٱسۡمَ","رَبِّهِۦ","فَصَلَّىٰ"],"t":"And mentions the name of his Lord, and prays","l":"Wa Dhakara Asma Rabbihi Fasalla","w":[["wadhakara","And remembers"],["is'ma","(the) name"],["rabbihi","(of) his Lord"],["faṣallā","and prays"]]},{"a":["بَلۡ","تُؤۡثِرُونَ","ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنۡيَا"],"t":"But you prefer the present life","l":"Bal Tu'uthiruna Al-Hayaata Ad-Dunya","w":[["bal","Nay"],["tu'thirūna","You prefer"],["l-ḥayata","the life"],["l-dun'yā","(of) the world"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡأٓخِرَةُ","خَيۡرٞ","وَأَبۡقَىٰٓ"],"t":"Though the Hereafter is better, and more lasting","l":"Wa Al-'Akhiratu Khayrun Wa 'Abqa","w":[["wal-ākhiratu","While the Hereafter"],["khayrun","(is) better"],["wa-abqā","and everlasting"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","هَٰذَا","لَفِي","ٱلصُّحُفِ","ٱلۡأُولَىٰ"],"t":"This is in